{"3946420": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Scarecrow’s Curse", "steam_appid": 3946420, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can you tell the difference between reality and error?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Anomali is a psychological observation horror game built around attention, memory, and tension. Your task is simple: Inspect the rooms. If something is wrong, report it. If nothing is wrong, reset the system.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But are you sure?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every small detail matters. An object may have changed its position. The lights may behave differently. Or something that should not be there… is now there.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Correct decisions keep the system stable. Wrong decisions have consequences. With increasing difficulty, randomly generated anomalies, and a decision-based progression system, each playthrough offers a different experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Psychological horror atmosphere<br>Minimal yet disturbing sound design<br>Decision-based outcome system<br>Randomly generated anomalies<br>Replayable structure<br>Multiple endings</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Warning:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game requires high attention. Some anomalies may be difficult to notice.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can you tell the difference between reality and error?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Anomali is a psychological observation horror game built around attention, memory, and tension. Your task is simple: Inspect the rooms. If something is wrong, report it. If nothing is wrong, reset the system.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But are you sure?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every small detail matters. An object may have changed its position. The lights may behave differently. Or something that should not be there… is now there.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Correct decisions keep the system stable. Wrong decisions have consequences. With increasing difficulty, randomly generated anomalies, and a decision-based progression system, each playthrough offers a different experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Psychological horror atmosphere<br>Minimal yet disturbing sound design<br>Decision-based outcome system<br>Randomly generated anomalies<br>Replayable structure<br>Multiple endings</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Warning:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game requires high attention. Some anomalies may be difficult to notice.</p>", "short_description": "Anomali is a psychological observation game in which the player carefully examines rooms, detects changes and abnormal situations, and attempts to keep the system stable by making the right decisions.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, Traditional Chinese<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3946420/65fcb75ae19207819124f38b614817ee1b9b6d12/header.jpg?t=1771048351", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3946420/94cff911981fae00046d035bea2b5e6852753e25/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1771048351", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3946420/94cff911981fae00046d035bea2b5e6852753e25/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1771048351", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i3-4160<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce GT 730 / AMD Radeon R7 240<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 2 GB available space</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": [], "linux_requirements": [], "developers": ["Silvain"], "publishers": ["Ssyp